# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts: call: code code passes the code itself as data through the general admission;
# #dynamic: the data map holds the root heads, whatever their initializer): y is a root head of S although its
# initializer is computed, so S as data provides it. call: S S runs give once and publishes 42 into the y of S; R then
# reads that place through call: R S, so seen is 42. A map built only from literal fields misses y and throws. Entry 7.
int: calls 0
int: seen 0
fn: give () int
    node\calls: node\calls + 1
    return: 42
end: give
S:
    int: x 5
    int: y give()
end: S
R:
    int: y
    node\seen: y
end: R
fn: unit_seen () int
    return: node\seen
end: unit_seen
fn: unit_calls () int
    return: node\calls
end: unit_calls
call: S S
call: R S
int: r 81
if: unit_seen() = 42 && unit_calls() = 1 && S\x = 5
    r: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
